    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this 3 bedroom, 3 bath semi-detached property to the market located in the quiet Cul-de-sac of Earlsfort Lane, Lucan. The Earlsfort Development is a highly desirable location which finds itself within a stone's throw of a choice of essential amenities and dedicated transport links. You will find the M50 motorway mere minutes by car and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre within a brisk walk. Internal living accommodation of c. 94 sq.m comprises of entrance hallway with guest wc, lounge and open plan kitchen/diner to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three well-proportioned bedrooms with the master benefitting from ensuite and also a family bathroom. Externally you will find a fully enclosed with patio and lawn area with side access to the front which benefits from a gated driveway for off road parking. No. 31 is offered to the market in  great condition throughout, further benefits here include gas central heating, double glazed windows, no onward chain and is situated in a highly sought after cul de sac. Based on recent success within this development we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest.\n\n\nFeatures\n\nBER C2\nc. 94 Sqm\n3 bed, 3 bath\nNo onward chain\nGated driveway to front\nSought after location\nQuiet, peaceful cul de sac\nClose to amenities\nFantastic opportunity\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nEntering Earlsfort Avenue from Castle Road, take the 3rd right turn onto Earlsfort Drive and Earlsfort lane will be your next left turn. No. 31 will be round on your left hand side."
      },
      {
